+/* =====================================================================
+   SUNFLOWER THEME — phase 3B: memories page details. Decoration only, scoped to the memories page.
+   A tiny bloom beside the chapter label, a leaf sprig on each card corner, two small blooms + a few faint petals tucked behind the grid.
+   Cards, photos, tilt, hover and text are untouched. theme.sunflower:false removes every element added here.
+   ===================================================================== */
+body[data-page="memories"] .head>.hand{position:relative;width:fit-content;margin-inline:auto}   /* same look; lets the bloom hang off the label without shifting it */
+body[data-page="memories"] .sfm-lab{position:absolute;left:100%;top:50%;width:1.15em;height:1.13em;margin:-.58em 0 0 .3em;overflow:visible;pointer-events:none;
